gcloud-completion

Generated completion data is derived from Google Cloud CLI's
data/cli/gcloud_completions.py, distributed by Google LLC under Apache License 2.0.
The generated files convert the original command and flag dictionaries into the
Fig specification format and add loading boundaries and positional placeholders.
They do not include account information or live Google Cloud resource data.

Google Cloud CLI: https://cloud.google.com/sdk
Figxit: https://github.com/en3sis/figxit
